  triage:title "BA.3 acceptance criterion 2 unmet: 29 of 32 doc-named tests do not exist under any name" ;
  triage:description "fenix pre-review of BA.3 COMPLETE sha 82ff24ded (PR #1402), comment https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1402#issuecomment-5642824942. The doc-named runtime file crates/atm-http-runtime/tests/herdr_nudge_invariant.rs does not exist. Present: blocked_without_task_still_escalates_once, idle_member_with_open_mail_holds_mail_pending, escalation_ownership_architecture_test. Missing (29 named tests, non-exhaustive excerpt): dispose_table_is_exhaustive, active_member_with_stalled_task_holds, threshold_is_terminal, rate_limit_boundary, rate_limit_clock_reversal_is_not_due, episode_map_replaces_kind_on_flip_and_clears_on_recovery, escalation_summary_is_stable, idle_member_with_queued_task_is_nudged_once_per_interval, active_member_is_never_prompted, non_herdr_idle_member_with_task_is_nudged_through_its_backend, member_without_dispatchable_backend_holds_and_logs_once, blocked_member_gets_one_message_zero_nudges_per_episode, offline_member_gets_one_message_zero_nudges_per_episode, daemon_restart_does_not_reescalate_ongoing_episode, recovered_then_reblocked_episode_is_reported_again, recipients_only_episode_is_not_duplicated_after_restart, poll_failure_produces_no_episode, episode_message_summary_and_body, tenth_reminder_escalates_once_then_silence, close_of_stalled_task_resumes_nudging_on_next_task, reopen_of_stalled_task_escalates_again_at_threshold, handoff_applies_start_and_sends_receipt_to_assigner, head_already_active_handoff_sends_no_receipt, failed_start_write_then_active_member_still_starts_once, member_turning_active_between_dispose_and_emit_is_not_prompted, third_refusal_holds_and_escalates_once, non_refused_close_releases_refusal_hold, escalation_mail_does_not_consume_prompt_budget, breaker_open_produces_no_escalation_mail. Fix task BA3-FIX-R1 dispatched to arch-ctm." ;
